fixture ground_corner_lift
doc BUILD.md s5 Ground: "Corner correction: Horizontal: 8 u nudge over ledge corners"; s15 "the corner-correction nudge is invisible"
room test/corners
spawn 560 544
frames 60
input
  # A run-up jump at the 3-tile block (x 640..768, top 448); the feet arrive a few units under
  # its top edge and are lifted onto it instead of catching the corner.
  0..9 R
  10..17 R jump
  18..59 R
end
expect
  mark lifted 0..59 nudge_y<0
  at lifted nudge_y>=-8u
  mark on_top lifted..59 ground=1
  at on_top y=448u
end
